      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    face_value = 100\n    annual_coupon_rate = 0.10\n    spot_rates = [0.08, 0.09, 0.095]\n    annual_coupon_payment = face_value * annual_coupon_rate\n\n    # Discount each cash flow using its corresponding spot rate\n    cash_flows = [\n        annual_coupon_payment,\n        annual_coupon_payment,\n        annual_coupon_payment + face_value,\n    ]\n    bond_value = sum(\n        cash_flow / (1 + spot_rate) ** year\n        for year, (cash_flow, spot_rate) in enumerate(\n            zip(cash_flows, spot_rates), start=1\n        )\n    )\n    answer = round(bond_value, 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
